cff-version: 1.2.0
title: uiagBot
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jakob
    family-names: Maisch
repository-code: 'https://github.com/uiag/uiagBot'
abstract: >-
  uiagBot is a UCI chess engine written from scratch in C, with a bitboard
  move generator, a PVS search with modern pruning and Lazy SMP, and a choice
  of a hand-crafted evaluation or a (768 -> 1024) x 2 -> 1 perspective
  network with SCReLU, king-bucketed inputs and output buckets, trained from
  scratch on the public Lichess evaluation dump. The repository also contains
  the network's training pipeline, the test harness every change was measured
  with, and the bot that plays the engine on Lichess.
keywords:
  - chess
  - chess engine
  - UCI
  - NNUE
  - lichess
license: AGPL-3.0
